<title>FRANCE: INSEE sees 1996 French GDP up 1.2 pct.</title>
<headline>INSEE sees 1996 French GDP up 1.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>National statistics office INSEE gave the following forecasts for gross domestic product data (base 1980, changes from previous quarters in percent except stocks variation, in billions of 1980 francs).</p>
<p>The figures were part of a revision of its half yearly assessment of the economy.</p>
<p>			    Q2 96  Q3 96  Q4 96  1994   1995  1996</p>
<p> Total GDP		 -0.4   1.0     0.4   2.8    2.2   1.2</p>
<p> Imports		   -0.8   1.4     1.2   6.7    5.4   0.8</p>
<p> Exports		   -2.0   0.4     1.7   6.0    6.0   1.3</p>
<p> Household consumption -0.8   1.5    -1.1   1.4    1.8   2.5</p>
<p> Public consumption     0.5   0.5     0.4   1.1    0.9   1.8</p>
<p> Investment		-0.6   0.9     0.9   1.3    2.7    0.2</p>
<p> Stocks variation	-4.7  -4.5     1.4   4.9   13.6   -17.1</p>
<p> Total Jobs		-0.5   1.1     0.6   3.6    3.9     1.1</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5381</p>
</text>
